    {
      "id": "https://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/cmecf-service-disruption-8212026#a95ee2674c393bbc",
      "url": "https://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/cmecf-service-disruption-8212026",
      "title": "CM/ECF Service Disruption on 8/21/2026",
      "content_text": "Friday, August 21, 2026\nOn August 21, 2026, the Court was notified of a nationwide service disruption that affected the delivery of automated CM/ECF emails, including Notices of Electronic Filing (NEFs) and Notices of Docket Activity.\nAlthough delayed notices are now beginning to be delivered, users may continue to experience delays.\nPlease be aware of this disruption and contact the Court if you have any questions.\nhttps://www.med.uscourts.gov",
      "date_published": "2026-08-21T00:00:00+00:00",
      "_first_seen": "2026-08-22T01:48:58.160173+00:00",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"node__content\">\n<div class=\"field field--name-field-news-date field--type-date field--label-hidden\"><div class=\"field__items\"><div class=\"field__item even\"><span class=\"date-display-single\" content=\"2026-08-21T00:00:00-04:00\" datatype=\"xsd:dateTime\" property=\"dc:date\">Friday, August 21, 2026</span></div></div></div><div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden\"><div class=\"field__items\"><div class=\"field__item even\" property=\"content:encoded\"><p>On August 21, 2026, the Court was notified of a nationwide service disruption that affected the delivery of automated CM/ECF emails, including Notices of Electronic Filing (NEFs) and Notices of Docket Activity. <br/>\nAlthough delayed notices are now beginning to be delivered, users may continue to experience delays.  <br/>\nPlease be aware of this disruption and contact the Court if you have any questions.  <a href=\"https://www.med.uscourts.gov\">https://www.med.uscourts.gov</a></p>\n</div></div></div> </div>",
      "tags": [
        "Federal Maine-Related",
        "District Court notices"
      ]
    },
